    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "I tried an AI tutor last semester, and honestly, it was a mixed bag. It explained concepts patiently, but the abstract nature of math still tripped me up. The step-by-step breakdowns helped *somewhat*, but I found myself anxious when the AI assumed prior knowledge I lacked. Still, it was better than nothing—like having a patient but overly optimistic teacher who never gives up on you.",
